# NOTICE

This project builds on the following third-party components and artifacts:

- ORION ([GitHub](https://github.com/xiaomi-mlab/Orion), [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.19755))
  (Apache-2.0, (c) Xiaomi and HUST) - the VLA model this repository deploys. The
  ORION checkpoint, the pretrain_qformer weights, and the EVA02 vision
  encoder + projector weights are hosted upstream and are NOT redistributed by
  this repository; see [ckpts/README.md](ckpts/README.md) for the download table.
- The upstream training repositories (ORION training repo, Orion-Lite variant)
  provide the model definitions (vendored mmcv fork, adzoo/orion model code)
  our pipeline imports at runtime; they are referenced via ORION_PROJECT_ROOT /
  ORION_LITE_PROJECT_ROOT and are not redistributed.
- NVIDIA TensorRT / TensorRT-LLM - inference engines; the full_hidden_states
