  pretrain_qformer; EVA-02 (NVlabs/BAAI) - the vision backbone pretraining;
  OmniDrive (NVlabs) - the PETR projection weights.
- Bench2Drive (Apache-2.0) - the closed-loop benchmark whose data the eval and
  distill data collection consume; see data/README.md.
- onnxsim_large_model ([GitHub](https://github.com/luchangli03/onnxsim_large_model),
